sentences.text:
On due consideration to the submissions advanced, perusal of the record so also the facts that the applicant is father-in-law; has no criminal antecedents; languishing in jail since 16.12.2023;
charge-sheet has been filed and there are no antemortem injury on the body of the deceased except ligature mark and without expressing any opinion on merits of the case, I find it to be a fit case for enlarging the applicant on bail.
Accordingly, the bail application is allowed.

